  "description": "Designed to help you to convert any complex HTML pages saturated by CSS and Javascript to PDF documents.\n- Convert HTML to PDF\n- Get screenshot from HTML\n- Convert multipage-TIFF to PDF\n- Generate PDF from JPEG, PNG, GIF, Bitmap, TIFF\n- Create PDF from pack of images at once, like a Photo Gallery\n- Compatible on multiple platforms, such as Windows, macOS, and Linux\n- Deploy to Azure and AWS\n\t\t  Requires only .NET Framework 4.6.2 or higher. Can be used in .NET 6.0 and higher.\n\t\t  Absolutely standalone library.",
